idence\": \"Logged in as registered account timothee.tester@example.com with wrong password \\\"WrongPassword999\\\"; got toast \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\", login denied.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Viewed \\\"Mid-Century Modern Armchair\\\" owned by seller Emma Green while logged in as Timothee Tester. Page shows only \\\"Add to Cart\\\" and \\\"Message Seller\\\" buttons, no edit/delete/manage controls. Since no edit UI exists for any listing (see FT-2/FT-3), other users' listings cannot be modified by the current user either.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitted Create Listing form with all fields empty; form did not submit, page stayed on /create-listing and focus moved to the required Title field (browser validation blocked submission).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Entered price -50 with all other required fields filled; form did not submit (stayed on page), field validity check shows min=0 and validationMessage \\\"Value must be greater than or equal to 0.\\\"\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"A toast notification appeared immediately: 'An account with this email already exists', providing clear visual feedback for the duplicate registration attempt.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search results updated immediately as text was typed into the searchbox, without pressing Enter or a submit button - results and item count changed live.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Toggling category/condition checkboxes updated the product grid and item count immediately without any submit/apply button click required, confirming real-time filter updates.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Toast notification \\\"Added to cart!\\\" appeared immediately after clicking Add to Cart, plus cart badge count updated from empty to \\\"1\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Inspected all 10 product cards' img src/alt attributes: every image's alt text exactly matches its product title (e.g., 'Reclaimed Wood Bookshelf', 'Vintage Brass Floor Lamp', 'Sony Noise-Canceling Headphones'), and each maps to a distinct, category-appropriate Unsplash stock photo URL. Only my own self-created listing ('Test Vintage Chair', created via the Sell form without a custom photo upload) reuses the same default placeholder photo as 'Mid-Century Modern Armchair' (both chair-category items), consistent with expected fallback/default-image behavior for listings created without an uploaded photo rather than a mismatch bug.\"}]}"
